The application identifier facts in `src/digital-link.ts` (which identifiers can be a
primary key, the key qualifiers each one allows, the shape of their values and how their
check digits work) were checked against the table published in the GS1 Digital Link
Toolkit, https://github.com/gs1/GS1DigitalLinkToolkit.js, which is licensed Apache-2.0.

The criteria named by the tests in `test/conformance.test.ts` are quoted from
`ConformantResolver1_0.txt` in https://github.com/gs1/GS1DL-resolver-testsuite, also
Apache-2.0.

No code from either repository is included here.
